(7479927, 1189481, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok. In this case, the title was distracting!! I was having fun searching around the photo, but it bugged me that I didn''t know the word, so I had to go look it up. Yet I wasn''t done looking at the photo. So whether you were aware, the biggest distraction was the title! (cool photo, though. I see an eye and a mouth that kind of mesmerizing...</td>', 'Ok. In this case, the title was distracting!! I was having fun searching around the photo, but it bugged me that I didn''t know the word, so I had to go look it up. Yet I wasn''t done looking at the photo. So whether you were aware, the biggest distraction was the title! (cool photo, though. I see an eye and a mouth that kind of mesmerizing...', '2016-10-30 11:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
