(7479930, 1189477, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok -- I was going back and forth on whether I''d consider anything a distracting element. It seems to all fit to well to really be a distracting element. (doesn''t matter for the score -- I see why it might be considered one, so that''s close enough. But what was distracting was the composition just didn''t seem right. It''s a great find, and a great bird, but the centering of the photo just seemed wrong to me. It''s like taking something hidden and shouting to the world that "here it is"! It''s such a nice little scene, that I want it to be just a little more of a mystery/discovery. So I''d get rid of the vignette, and move her off center someplace so people can have the joy of the discovery. -6- as is. (just musing out loud on the comment. :)</td>', 'Ok -- I was going back and forth on whether I''d consider anything a distracting element. It seems to all fit to well to really be a distracting element. (doesn''t matter for the score -- I see why it might be considered one, so that''s close enough. But what was distracting was the composition just didn''t seem right. It''s a great find, and a great bird, but the centering of the photo just seemed wrong to me. It''s like taking something hidden and shouting to the world that "here it is"! It''s such a nice little scene, that I want it to be just a little more of a mystery/discovery. So I''d get rid of the vignette, and move her off center someplace so people can have the joy of the discovery. -6- as is. (just musing out loud on the comment. :)', '2016-10-30 11:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7479931, 1189470, 103142, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m really loving this, but I so much want it to be darker/moodier. It''s wonderful, but seems incredibly bright... 7 as is, but I think it could have gone up to a 9. It''s so close...</td>', 'Ok, I''m really loving this, but I so much want it to be darker/moodier. It''s wonderful, but seems incredibly bright... 7 as is, but I think it could have gone up to a 9. It''s so close...', '2016-10-30 11:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(7479932, 1189487, 103142, '<td valign="top">That works. :)  -7-</td>', 'That works. :)  -7-', '2016-10-30 11:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
